# game/Story01.rpy:1680
translate russian firstanswernext_a6899abf:

    # am "Very well. What did the ship whisper to you, once you stepped inside?"
    am "Хорошо. Что прошептал корабль, когда вы вошли внутрь?"

# game/Story01.rpy:1688
translate russian firstanswernext_ebbe3d0b:

    # mc "The ship was quiet. Cold, maybe. But nothing unusual."
    mc "Корабль был тихим. Холодным, можем. Но ничего необычного."

# game/Story01.rpy:1692
translate russian firstanswernext_ffb4ce26:

    # am "Then you weren’t paying attention."
    am "Значит, ты не обращал внимания."

# game/Story01.rpy:1698
translate russian firstanswernext_1e52191c:

    # mc "There were definitely a few moments. Something felt... wrong."
